+  - `DTypeTrait<T>::abs/max/min` — type-dispatched math (fp32, fp16/bf16 scalar and x2, integrals)
+  - `DTypeTrait<T>::sqrt/rsqrt/exp/sin/cos(x)` — `fp32_t` only
